OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMostly dry
OL,6,Fthrough the evening with just the
OL,7,Fchance of the odd shower. Some showers
OL,8,Fovernight, mostly for Argyll, with
OL,9,Fsome clear spells across Ayrshire and
OL,10,FLanarkshire.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FWarm or very warm with
OL,13,Fbright spells and just the odd sharp
OL,14,Fshower possible. Cloudy with
OL,15,Foccasionally heavy showers across
OL,16,FArgyll.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
