OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FCooler
OL,6,Fand mainly cloudy on Friday and
OL,7,FSaturday with sunny intervals and a
OL,8,Ffew showers. Mainly dry and bright on
OL,9,FSunday with a small chance of rain
OL,10,Flater.
